<title>SWEDEN: Astra says U.S. Losec Q1 sales up 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Astra says U.S. Losec Q1 sales up 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drugs company Astra said on Wednesday that U.S. sales of its anti-ulcer agent Losec through its joint venture Astra Merck Inc rose 24 percent in the first quarter to $515 million.</p>
</text>
